Tester 49243: „gamarjoba" took 31.2 s, 24.7 s and 31.0 s on three seats
(get_user_notes, get_my_tasks, get_pending_updates), where „გამარჯობა" took
3.3 s with no tools. The bare-greeting reading knew Georgian, English,
Russian and Spanish hellos, but not Georgian typed in Latin letters.

gamarjoba, gagimarjos, salami and dila/saghamo mshvidobisa now read as a
bare greeting, with or without „rogor khar". The server greeting answers
„rogor khar" the way it already answers „როგორ ხარ".

DONE WHEN: „gamarjoba" on 3 seats is answered in under 5 s with no tools,
in Georgian where the seat writes Georgian.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
